@startuml uc006-ssd
!include ../../../diagrams/style.iuml
title UC-006 Run complete evaluation: system sequence diagram

actor Developer
participant "JudgeLab" as System
actor "Target model" as Target
actor "Judge model" as Judge

Developer -> System : run(config file, output directory?)
alt 1a: the setup is invalid (config, benchmark, rubric, connection, key)
  System --> Developer : "error: ..." on stderr, exit code 1
  note right of System
    No model called, no report written,
    no traceback, no pasted key echoed.
  end note
else the setup is valid
  System --> Developer : benchmark name and size, target, judge and rubric
  loop for each test case, in order
    System -> Target : question (UC-003)
    Target --> System : answer, refusal or error
    opt 3a: the answer can be trusted (not failed, not cut off)
      System -> Judge : judge request (UC-004), a refusal marked [refused]
      Judge --> System : verdict, or error or unusable reply
    end
    System --> Developer : progress line "[i/n] id: OUTCOME"
  end
  System -> System : write report (UC-005)
  System --> Developer : totals, pass rate with coverage, report path, exit code 0
end

note over Developer, System
  1c: no --config: usage message, exit code 2.
end note
@enduml
